Z||000022||GREENDANO||06-19-99||05:35 PM||||Batboy,<br> We're cool...That's why I didn't bash you, it's hard to emulate the tone of your message with words.<br>  As far as the S-10 brakes, I think the caliper adapters are available seperately for the front brakes.  That would be a HUGE upgrade.  I have the Grand Am brakes on my GT and they are more than I need for this car.  Cheaper too!!<br>  FYI, I plan on crossdrilling a set of GA rotors for my GT next winter. Remember I said they offered no real performance gains for a street car, I'm doing it because they look cool, and plus, I can do the work myself.  <br>  Dan-O
